{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>Tell me, I pray, your name.</b> Which indicates your form and the active emanation drawn from you, so that I may reflect on the matter for which you rose to oppose me, and return in repentance and pray." "<b>Why do you ask for my name?</b> For the personal form is, for us, the level of the intellects, which cannot be expressed in any speech, as it says (Judges 13:18): וְהוּא פֶלִאי — and its active emanation is according to the divine will."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:03.129081814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}